1
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,481
太好了  卡拉OK机
Great. The karaoke machine.

2
00:00:21,660 --> 00:00:22,381
谢谢  米奇舅舅
Thanks, Uncle Mitch.

3
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:24,021
这是小卡的  他很喜欢它
It's Cam's, and he loves it.

4
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,910
他只要喝了两杯红酒
He's never more than two glasses of wine away

5
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,940
我们就躲不过一场即兴演唱会
from treating us all to an impromptu concert.

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,650
如果你把它弄坏  我给你一百块
It's 100 bucks if you break it.

7
00:00:29,661 --> 00:00:31,320
-真的吗  -你要更多吗
- Really? - Do you want more?

8
00:00:31,560 --> 00:00:33,860
谁是美国人最爱的电视妈妈角色
Who's America's favorite TV mom?

9
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,228
会是琼·
Could it be June...

10
00:00:36,238 --> 00:00:36,826
她在1954年电视剧《反斗小宝贝[海貍搞定]》中
饰演的妈妈角色  曾被誉为最受欢迎的妈妈

11
00:00:36,836 --> 00:00:37,140
克莉佛吗
Cleaver?

12
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,821
所以我就是海貍啦
That must make me the Beaver.

13
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,901
我听不大清  卢克的笑声有多大
I can't hear too well. How hard is Luke laughing?

14
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,501
这么好的哏别浪费在我这里
Don't waste this gold on me.

15
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,881
去亨德森一家的派对
Get over to the Hendersons' party,

16
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:46,140
玩玩老套社交游戏  跳跳老气哈娑舞
put your keys in a bowl, do the Hustle.

17
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:48,313
别紧张
Relax.

18
00:00:48,334 --> 00:00:49,530
你不酷的父母
Your uncool parents

19
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,962
不会出现在你的派对上
aren't gonna hang around your party

20
00:00:51,023 --> 00:00:52,160
把场面搞得很逊
and make it all lame.

21
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:54,644
当然不会啦
Of course not. Hey.

22
00:00:55,234 --> 00:00:58,150
我听说有个孩子开了无大人监管的派对
I just heard a story about a kid who had an unsupervised party

23
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:00,730
结果一位客人摔断了腿
and one of the guests broke his leg

24
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:02,890
因为他从屋顶跳到蹦床上
because he jumped off the roof onto a trampoline

25
00:01:02,900 --> 00:01:03,741
后来这人还告了主办人父母
and sued the parents.

26
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,680
对哦  我们有蹦床  也有屋顶
We have a trampoline. And a roof.

27
00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:06,841
我得确定你是在开玩笑
I need to know that you're joking.

28
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,080
妈妈  一切都在我的掌控中
Mom, I have everything under control.

29
00:01:10,566 --> 00:01:11,180
克莱尔  别这样
Claire, come on!

30
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:13,260
他是个负责任的好青年
He's a responsible young man!

31
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,360
对你儿子有点信心吧
Have a little faith in your son.

32
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:16,821
这些都是紧急电话
These are all the emergency numbers.

33
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:19,224
消防队  警察  毒物控制中心  国土安全部
That's Fire, Police, Poison Control, Homeland Security.

34
00:01:19,245 --> 00:01:19,761
你来负责
You're in charge.

35
00:01:19,771 --> 00:01:22,020
除非你碰巧有别的安排
I mean, unless you... happen to have other plans.

36
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,840
是啊  就假装昨晚我狂欢得太疯了吧
Yeah, let's just pretend I partied too hard last night.

37
00:01:24,940 --> 00:01:25,841
你简直是派对狂
You're an animal.

38
00:01:26,964 --> 00:01:28,001
-靠  -怎么了
- Dang it! - What's wrong?

39
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,101
这花别正了吗
Is this flower straight?

40
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:29,742
我不知道
I don't know. Oh!

41
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:33,541
万圣节恶作剧
Halloween prank!

42
00:01:33,561 --> 00:01:34,760
这是报复去年
That's payback from last year.

43
00:01:35,060 --> 00:01:36,261
普里契特有债必偿
A Pritchett always pays his debts.

44
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:38,021
我不知道你在说什么
I have no idea what you're talking about.

45
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:39,381
佛利德曼家的泳池派对
The Friedmans' pool party.

46
00:01:39,776 --> 00:01:40,696
我就是那意思
That's what I say.

47
00:01:40,980 --> 00:01:43,562
这是什么  经典
What is -- Classic.

48
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:45,700
有苍蝇的冰块这整人老哏
The old fly in the plastic ice cube gag.

49
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:48,602
真搞笑
Very funny! Very --

50
00:01:48,612 --> 00:01:49,160
不
No!

51
00:01:50,540 --> 00:01:51,838
你在融化
You're melting!

52
00:01:52,082 --> 00:01:53,400
你在融化
You're melting!

53
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,980
冰块是我做的
I did the ice cube.

54
00:01:56,580 --> 00:01:58,520
现在换你湿了
Well, now you're the one who's wet.

55
00:01:58,660 --> 00:02:00,460
不算是  大部分水都在地板上
Not really. Most of it's on the floor.

56
00:02:02,263 --> 00:02:02,641
菲尔  你没事吧
Phil, are you okay?

57
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,700
我没事
I'm fine. Yeah.

58
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:06,450
如果海貍踩到水滑到了
Hey, you know what the Beaver said

59
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:07,641
你知道他会说什么吗
when he slipped in water?

60
00:02:07,860 --> 00:02:09,002
-我靠[盖水坝挡水]  -我靠
- Damn it? - Damn it.

61
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:25,550
杰  作为天主教徒  我觉得这样不对
Jay, as a Catholic, I do not feel right about this.

62
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:27,101
耶稣[天啊]  玛利亚和约瑟夫
Jesus, Mary, and Joseph.

63
00:02:27,780 --> 00:02:29,700
这是超完美的家庭变装主题
It's the perfect family costume.

64
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:32,841
根本讲不通  应该是乔扮耶稣宝宝
It doesn't even make sense. Joe should be the Jesus.

65
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:33,862
是的
Yeah!

66
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:35,641
乔是约[乔]瑟夫的简称
"Joe" Short for "Joseph."

67
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:37,349
杰是"杰"稣的简称
"Jay" Short for "Jaysus."

68
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:39,860
只有这样才讲得通
It's the only way it makes sense.

69
00:02:40,060 --> 00:02:41,381
但他才是宝宝
But he's the child.

70
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:42,481
你想多了
You're overthinking it.

71
00:02:42,540 --> 00:02:44,600
你懂我扮的是谁  对吧
Huh? You get who this is, right?

72
00:02:44,610 --> 00:02:45,873
哈丽特·浴缸男[塔布曼]
Harriet Tub Man?

73
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:48,521
作家乔伊斯·卡罗尔·漂浮[欧茨]
Oh, Joyce Carol Floats.

74
00:02:49,700 --> 00:02:52,020
演员法拉·水龙头[福赛特]  开水的水...
Farrah Faucet, spelled F-A-U --

75
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:52,774
我懂你意思
Yeah, I get it.

76
00:02:52,917 --> 00:02:54,130
你为什么只猜女人啊
And why are you only guessing women?

77
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:56,860
我是达尔顿·特朗勃  被列入黑名单的编剧
I'm Dalton Trumbo, blacklisted screenwriter,

78
00:02:56,870 --> 00:02:57,110
1947-57年间  二战后对共产主义的恐惧与仇恨
使美国娱乐业中被认为支持共产主义者  皆上了黑名单

79
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:57,881
在浴缸里创作
wrote in a bathtub.

80
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,730
我有点担心去年他的传记电影出来后
I'm a little worried that because of the movie,

81
00:02:59,740 --> 00:03:01,141
很多人都会弄这个打扮
a lot of people will have this costume.

82
00:03:01,260 --> 00:03:03,170
我觉得没事  参加卢克派对的人
I think you're good. Nobody going to Luke's party

83
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:05,040
绝对不会弄明白你扮的是谁
will ever be able to figure out that costume.

84
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:07,000
所以我要去参加另一场派对
Yeah, that's why I'm going to a different party.

85
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:09,550
你不能为了去别人的派对而不去卢克的派对
You're not skipping Luke's party to go to someone else's.

86
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:11,310
卢克的派对上人会很多的
There's going to be a million people at Luke's.

87
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,400
他不会在乎我去了没
He's not going to care whether or not I attend.

88
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,405
曼尼  这是因为卢克战胜了你
Manny, is this because Luke beat you

89
00:03:15,446 --> 00:03:16,500
成为了学生会主席吗
for class president?

90
00:03:17,020 --> 00:03:20,220
你为什么忘不掉这惨绝人寰的羞辱呢
Why can't you get over this devastating humiliation?

91
00:03:20,660 --> 00:03:22,100
因为总有人事物让我一直想起
Because something keeps me reminding me.

92
00:03:22,110 --> 00:03:23,410
但这跟那件事无关
But it has nothing to do with that.

93
00:03:23,420 --> 00:03:25,210
苏菲·钱伯斯办了一场派对
Sophie Chambers is throwing a party

94
00:03:25,220 --> 00:03:26,476
参加的人成熟多了
with a much more sophisticated crow--

95
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:28,650
你不许参加奸人厄尔·钱伯斯家族里
You're not going to any party thrown by any member

96
00:03:28,660 --> 00:03:30,520
任何人举办的任何派对
of that crooked Earl Chambers family.

97
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:33,721
那杂种从我眼皮下偷走了我的橱柜公司
That bastard stole my closet company right out from under me!

98
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:34,870
不不
No, no, no, no, no.

99
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:37,380
你扮成了耶稣的样子  就别说"杂种"了
Don't say the word "Bastard" when you're dressed like Jesus!

100
00:03:37,540 --> 00:03:39,600
你  决不能背叛家人
And you -- never turn your back on family.

101
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:42,690
我戈麦斯表哥没去我另一个戈麦斯表哥的派对
My cousin Gomez skipped my other cousin Gomez's party,

102
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:46,300
我戈麦斯表哥感觉背后被人捅了刀
and my cousin Gomez felt completely stabbed in the back.

103
00:03:46,310 --> 00:03:47,901
-因为他...  -因为他就是被捅了
- Because he -- - Because he was.

104
00:03:48,140 --> 00:03:51,140
拜托  派对会在苏菲祖父的住宅举办
Come on. The party's going to be at Sophie's grandpa's mansion.

105
00:03:51,260 --> 00:03:52,750
这是本季的社交大事
It's the social event of the season.

106
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:54,101
你得去参加卢克的派对
You're going to Luke's!

107
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,281
凭什么啊
That's not fair!

108
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,981
你听到你妈说的话了  你得去参加卢克的派对
You heard your mother! You're going to Luke's!

109
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,501
-你去参加厄尔家的派对吧  -什么
- You're going to Earl's. - What?

110
00:03:58,820 --> 00:04:00,510
但你必须往他鞋子里放死鱼
You're gonna put dead fish in his shoes.

111
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,720
做为交换  如果你妈起疑心  我会替你掩护
And I'm gonna cover for you if your mother gets suspicious.

112
00:04:02,980 --> 00:04:04,082
我怎么把鱼夹带进去啊
Where am I going to hide fish?

113
00:04:04,123 --> 00:04:05,020
你在浴缸里哎
You're in a bathtub!

114
00:04:07,060 --> 00:04:08,481
-万圣节快乐  谢谢  -万圣节快乐
- Happy Halloween! Thank you. - Happy Halloween.

115
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,221
-他们就拿了一个  对吧  -是啊
- They just took one, right? - Yes.

116
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:11,830
我们还要分发多少糖果
How much candy do we have to hand out

117
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,941
我才能去讨糖果啊
before I go trick-or-treating?

118
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:15,160
我就不能带把刀自己去吗
Can't I just take a knife and go by myself?

119
00:04:15,340 --> 00:04:15,789
不行
No!

120
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:17,260
没人会惹我的
No one would mess with me.

121
00:04:19,120 --> 00:04:21,560
我就说她太小  不适合看帮派主题的《西区故事》
I told you she was too young for "West Side Story."

122
00:04:22,727 --> 00:04:23,041
你在干什么
Hmm. W-What are you doing?

123
00:04:23,940 --> 00:04:26,660
干嘛  这是我今晚会吃的唯一一根士力架
What? It's my one and only candy bar for the night.

124
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:27,401
我不会再吃士力架了
No more Snickers.

125
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,941
如果你不想被人笑[听到士力架]
If you don't want to hear any more snickers

126
00:04:29,060 --> 00:04:31,440
那就不要假装那是你最后一根
then don't pretend that's your last candy bar.

127
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,700
小卡吃了糖以后反应很大
Cam doesn't react well to candy.

128
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:38,360
所以我从来不吃  除了万圣节
Which is why I never eat it. Except on Halloween.

129
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:41,080
我承认  过去我太放纵自己了
And I admit, in years past, I may have overindulged.

130
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,150
他每次吃糖吃到嗨到山顶
Which leads to a crazy high

131
00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,860
过后就会飙泪自我厌恶到谷底
followed by a tearful, self-loathing crash.

132
00:04:46,926 --> 00:04:48,340
简直就是《醉乡情断》的翻版
It's a Days of Red Vines and Roses.

133
00:04:48,350 --> 00:04:49,690
美国1966年电影  讲述从小酌变成酗酒
最后幸福家庭被击垮的故事

134
00:04:49,700 --> 00:04:50,380
不给糖就捣蛋
Trick or treat!

135
00:04:50,581 --> 00:04:51,420
拿一颗吧
Yep, just take one.

136
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,109
我记得那个笑声  今年休想得逞
I know that laugh. Not this year.

137
00:04:56,413 --> 00:04:56,980
放手
Drop it.

138
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:58,438
你疯了
You're crazy.

139
00:04:58,458 --> 00:04:59,580
对  为正义疯狂
Yeah, crazy for justice!

140
00:04:59,780 --> 00:05:01,010
你穿得像个恶棍
And just because you're dressed like a villain

141
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,201
不见得就要表现得像个恶棍
doesn't mean you have to act like one!

142
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:04,600
天啊  你敢相信吗
Oh, my God. Can you believe that?

143
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:05,580
对啊  一个九岁的孩子
Yes, a 9-year-old kid

144
00:05:05,601 --> 00:05:07,057
想在万圣节多拿几颗糖
wanting extra candy on Halloween.

145
00:05:07,140 --> 00:05:07,841
真是太"莫名其妙"了
Oh, it is baffling.

146
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:10,290
说到九岁孩子在万圣节要糖...
Speaking of 9-year-olds wanting candy on Halloween...

147
00:05:10,300 --> 00:05:11,141
等等  亲爱的
Okay, just a second, honey.

148
00:05:11,280 --> 00:05:12,781
小卡  抓住一个孩子的胳膊
Cam, maybe grabbing a kid's arm

149
00:05:12,841 --> 00:05:14,220
真的不应该啊...
is where we draw the line.

150
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:15,881
我好像在每一本法律书上都读过
I think I read that in every single law book.

151
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:16,800
这话听著像是
This sounds like something

152
00:05:16,841 --> 00:05:18,316
我们可以在人行道上边走边聊的内容
we could be talking about on the sidewalk.

153
00:05:18,541 --> 00:05:20,461
稍等亲爱的  你知道吗  米奇尔
Okay, just a second, honey. You know what, Mitchell?

154
00:05:20,700 --> 00:05:23,880
就是那个小混蛋每年都拿一大把糖走
That same little jerk grabs a handful of candy every year.

155
00:05:23,960 --> 00:05:25,521
他是我的万圣节死敌
He's my Halloween nemesis.

156
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:27,620
这是一条社会契约
There is a social contract.

157
00:05:27,760 --> 00:05:29,540
说一句"不给糖就捣蛋"  只能拿一颗糖
You say "Trick or treat," you get one piece of candy.

158
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:32,300
这契约一但瓦解  我们就离没有法制
That breaks down, we're just a hop, skip, and a jump

159
00:05:32,341 --> 00:05:35,760
以破珠子和牙齿当钱的原始社会不远了
to a lawless wasteland where we use beads and teeth for money!

160
00:05:36,140 --> 00:05:37,621
你刚才说才吃第一根巧克力棒对吧
That was your first candy bar, you say?

161
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:39,350
你也许应该摄入点蛋白质
You think maybe you should have a little protein

162
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,154
来平衡一下糖分
to balance that out?

163
00:05:40,357 --> 00:05:41,740
我不需要蛋白质
I don't need any protein.

164
00:05:43,140 --> 00:05:45,090
可是老天爷好像想你补充"蛋白质"呢
I feel like the universe is telling you differently.

165
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:46,421
是谁干的
Who did that?!

166
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:50,380
他朝那边跑了  经过了所有发糖的房子
He went that way! Past all the houses handing out candy!

167
00:05:50,540 --> 00:05:51,421
交给我吧
I'm on it!

168
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,321
不  你看  他叫乔
No, see, his name is Joe.

169
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,680
对  可不都是小孩扮耶稣吗
